## The bell on the list's toolbar, for the open folder or inbox tab

quiet-tip-rings = 關閉通知
quiet-tip-off = 已關閉通知。按一下即可重新通知
quiet-tip-muted-until = 已關閉通知，直到 { $when }。按一下即可重新通知

## The right-click menu of a folder or an account

quiet-mute = 關閉通知…
quiet-unmute = 開啟通知
quiet-notify = 收到新郵件時通知

## How long to mute

quiet-for-hour = 1 小時
quiet-until-tomorrow = 直到明天早上
quiet-until-unmuted = 直到我重新開啟
quiet-turn-on = 收到新郵件時通知

## The note after a change, with Undo; { $name } is a folder, tab or account

quiet-off = 已關閉「{ $name }」的通知
quiet-muted-until = 已關閉「{ $name }」的通知，直到 { $when }
quiet-on = 「{ $name }」會重新通知

## Conversations and senders (the reading pane's bell, the More menus and
## the right-click menu)

quiet-mute-conversation = 將會話群組設為靜音
quiet-unmute-conversation = 取消會話群組靜音
quiet-mute-sender = 將寄件者設為靜音
quiet-unmute-sender = 取消寄件者靜音
quiet-row-muted = 已設為靜音
quiet-conversation-strip = 已設為靜音。新回覆不會通知，也不會計入未讀取數。
quiet-conversation-muted = { $count ->
   *[other] 已將 { $count } 個會話群組設為靜音
}
quiet-conversation-unmuted = { $count ->
   *[other] 已取消 { $count } 個會話群組的靜音
}
quiet-sender-strip = 已設為靜音。對方的郵件不會通知，也不會計入未讀取數。
quiet-sender-muted = 已將來自 { $address } 的郵件設為靜音
quiet-sender-unmuted = 來自 { $address } 的郵件會重新通知
